module j3.j2.parse — The j2 parser: tokens to an AST by recursive descent. Errors are values with the text

fn: parse binaryPrec print opText
const: F_PUB F_CONST F_THIS F_QUOTED MAX_DEPTH PREC_UNARY PREC_POSTFIX
enum Kind: Chunk Block Let FnDecl Use Assign Expr If While ForRange ForIn Break Continue Return
    Match Arm Nil True False Int Float Str Name Tpl Unary Binary Field Index Call Table Pair Array
    Fn
struct Node: kind op line col a b c first count flags i f s
struct Ast: file nodes kids root node() kid()

signatures and comments: `j3c doc j3.j2.parse`; one name: `j3c doc j3.j2.parse <name>`
